      "requirements": "<h3><strong>What we are looking for</strong></h3><p class=\"MsoNormal\">We are looking for someone who can clearly articulate their personal journey into Data Engineering and AI-first development, including real examples of how they have used AI to improve delivery.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You should be able to explain:</p><ul><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\">Your expertise in Data Engineering</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\">How your development workflow has become more productive because of AI.</p><ul><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\">Which AI tools you use, and for what types of work.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\">How you validate, review, and improve AI-generated outputs.</p>",
