      "max_hours": null,
      "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Petal is looking for an <strong>AI-First Data Engineer</strong> to join a small platform team building the next generation of our data platform, enabling advanced BI and enabling AI workflows across the organization.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">This is not a traditional data engineering role. We are looking for someone who has already made the shift to <strong>AI-first development</strong> and can show, through real examples, how they use AI to deliver faster, better, and with greater leverage.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The successful candidate will help transform Petal into an AI-first organization by combining strong data engineering fundamentals with practical, hands-on expertise in AI-assisted delivery. They will be expected to <strong>work, teach, influence, and lead</strong>.</p>",
